Welcome to our CCT211 Project! This is a TKinter GUI program that aims to have both persistance and meet the guidelines set out by CRUD (create, read, update, delete).
You can create new entries, update and delete them, and all of this data is read into a CSV file that is read into the program to display your data!

This is a video game tracker where users can keep track of all the video games they play across different platforms!

----------------------------- NOTE: please download the fonts specified in the fonts folder to have the best experience -------------------------------------------------------
      
additionally, there are some issues with Mac. these were unaddressable bugs as each Mac device had a different problem (one Macbook had a problem with the buttons taking a while to be responsive but the windows were normal, while another MacBook had no issues with buttons but the windows were not layered correctly). 
these issues were not related to the code and seemingly a TKinter issue. if possible, please run this program on Windows as there are no issues with Windows devices.                                                                                                                                        
